      <activity id="52253310-9262-5306-9533-f5fcfb236595" activityNameId="78ebcc4b-4fd0-5335-a3fb-cfa4567924be" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Coffee ground pellets, burned in furnace, ash to sanitary landfill</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Coffee ground pellets, burned in furnace, ash to sanitary landfill
Air emission coffee ground data completed with ecoinvent inventory of "pellets, mixed, burned in furnace 15kW";
UUID: cf59a01f-7180-37c0-a8e1-fc35cfb62f2f
This data set describes the emission into air caused by the combustion, infrastructure, fuelinput and transport are included
Location: The inventory is modelled for a pilot plant in Switzerland
Technology: Furnace 25kW
Time period: Collection of data and publication.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: Several air emissions estimated with data for wood combustion.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_cf59a01f-7180-37c0-a8e1-fc35cfb62f2f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
